  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c2f466d8acd888e47941c8dd5566b0bc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_KeeperVaris
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidborne::DialogueTree
  startNodeId: root
  nodes:
  - nodeId: root
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: "I've maintained this structure for twenty years. I don't know what it
      is \u2014 only that it hums when the sky changes and that the VORD leave it
      alone. That's reason enough to protect it."
    choices:
    - text: I know what it is.
      nextNodeId: reveal
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Tell me about Spire's Rest.
      nextNodeId: spire
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Any work up here?
      nextNodeId: quests
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Farewell.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: reveal
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: '...


      Then tell me. I have earned the right to know what I''ve been
      guarding.'
    choices:
    - text: It's a Stronghold. One of six built by the Architect.
      nextNodeId: reveal2
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Actually, I'll show you.
      nextNodeId: reveal_device
      condition:
        type: 5
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: reveal2
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: "The Architect...\n\nI have kept their work alive without knowing it. Whatever
      you need from me \u2014 access, protection, knowledge of the structure \u2014
      it's yours."
    choices:
    - text: I need to access the module inside.
      nextNodeId: module_access
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 4
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: varis_ally
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Thank you, Keeper.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: reveal_device
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: 'The structure... it''s responding to that device. The lighting just changed.
      Twenty years and I''ve never seen it do that.


      What are you?'
    choices:
    - text: Someone trying to finish what the Architect started.
      nextNodeId: reveal2
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: module_access
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: "The inner chamber is through the north gate \u2014 I can open it from
      here. No one has been inside since I arrived. Whatever is in there has been
      waiting a long time."
    choices:
    - text: Open it.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: spire
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: "We live on sky islands because the VORD rarely climb this high. The wind
      currents between islands are treacherous \u2014 most VORD constructs can't
      navigate them. Supply Runner Eli keeps us stocked."
    choices:
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: quests
    speakerName: Keeper Varis
    text: We've lost contact with the eastern island outpost. If you have a Gyrocopter
      or something that flies, I need someone to check on it.
    choices:
    - text: I'll look into it.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 4
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: varis_quest_accepted
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Not right now.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
